<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Persbel yr shr, div rises.</title>
<headline>Persbel yr shr, div rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)	  356.4	 vs   174.3</p>
<p>Shr, excluding</p>
<p>    exceptional items (cts)  217.5	 vs   174.3</p>
<p>Div (cts)</p>
<p>    - final			 24.0	 vs    18.8</p>
<p>    - total			 31.0	 vs    24.8</p>
<p>    Attrib income		 42.05	vs    20.57</p>
<p>    Pre-tax income		 4.02	vs     3.21</p>
<p>    Tax				0.18	vs     0.14</p>
<p>Retained income at</p>
<p>    end of period		 10.57	vs    10.39</p>
<p>Div payable around Decenmber 1</p>
